LOCATION:The Living Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Waitl
 ist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/197305\n\nBri
 ng your sharpest wit\, channel your competitive charm\, and roll the dice 
 for an evening of strategy\, luck\, and a touch of mischief. Hosted in The
  Living Room\, pick from one of our timeless classics or modern marvels an
 d let the games begin!\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for me
 mbers\, plus one registered guest.  Food and cocktails from The Living Ro
 om menu will be available for purchase.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/197305
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
END:VEVENT
