LOCATION:Meet in The Lobby
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 40 spots left\nS
 tatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/1982
 51\n\nJoin The 'Quin's art collection curator\, Kate Chertavian\, for a g
 uided walking tour of The Great Elephant Migration along the historic Com
 monwealth Avenue Mall. Explore the stories behind the life-size elephant s
 culptures while discovering the artists\, the project's global conservatio
 n mission\, and the collaborative effort that brought this extraordinary p
 ublic art installation to Boston.\n\n*This event is complimentary and rese
 rved for members\, plus one registered guest.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/198251
CATEGORIES:The Arts
